The plugin began as copies of two Omarchy 4.0.3 components, taken with
`omarchy plugin clone`, and carries local modifications:

  Bar.qml, BarModel.js, widgets/, indicators/   from Omarchy's `omarchy.bar`
  Panel.qml, Model.js                           from Omarchy's `omarchy.monitor`

The modifications are listed in docs/limitations.md under "Forks, not
extensions". Everything not listed there is upstream Omarchy code, unchanged and
redistributed under the same MIT terms.
